bcm2711-rpi-400.dtb STAND-IN (i346) -- not a real device tree blob.
Its 19-char name exceeds the 10-char B-DOS directory field, so
build-disk stores it as "bcm2711-rp" and the server serves it under
the full name via NBMANIFEST. Sized past one 1024-byte TFTP block so
the mapped-name transfer streams a full block plus a short final one.
